{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1279115-the-ruins-of-solfege-caelestis-white-elephant-for-taleksi","id":1279115,"title":"The Ruins of Solfege Caelestis [White Elephant for Taleksi]","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-01-06T21:04:23-08:00","id":1279115,"title":"The Ruins of Solfege Caelestis [White Elephant for Taleksi]","content":"You know, I thought at some point I'd leave procrastination behind. But here I am, an hour before deadline by my time zone. In my defense, I lost a lot of work and had to redo a lot of this when I realized I forgot to save before a system update mandated a reboot.<br /> <br /> ...That's not a great defense.<br /> <br /> ANYWAY:<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Taleksi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1272048-the-eighth-annual-exalted-white-elephant?p=1272340#post1272340\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">My Twilight is a treasure hunter, so I'd love to get an artifact for her to find or a ruin for her to explore. Alternatively, some art about her or anything about Sidereals, Raksha or Malfeas is very welcome.</div> </div> </div> </div>Okay, my art is only about stick-figure level, and not even Jukashi stick-figure level, so let's just go with the ruins, hm?<br /> <br /> Behold, Solar Hubris in action:<br /> <br /> <i>It was intended to soar for thousands of years, until the end of the Age, until the end of time. <br /> Instead, it sits, its supposedly imperishable construction broken and mostly buried in ice and snow.<br /> <br /> Eight towers rose from its perimeter, each one to sing its own song in a glorious and harmonious polyphony.<br /> Now it rests, only the tip of one tower elevated enough and clear enough to sing a single sustained note.<br /> <br /> It had many names: Solfege Caelestis, Adorjan\u2019s Sorrow, Nerishah\u2019s Folly, The Crowned Albatross.<br /> But ask the people of Creation now. Ask them of this place. See if any of them remember. The memory is as lost as the place itself.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/19wQMb65zzQU7KcqGu8FEbtX8KWxkT1xxf9sROvQQh6M/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">The History</a><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1nYRl2M2HSyd1hS7IvwyHVUe2ndjsbNLj3GjxW_Bcwuc/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">The Place, Then and Now</a><br /> <br /> The Sole Surviving Denizens, <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/16TUkG_1I0e678JcqMeTvaDJ3YvOvYG8rhGhMsertCMo/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">an Elemental</a> and <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1LQg-uAvR7S5DcTjd0XCGUpxzJzGg1uhmtEIn1M0KjYs/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">a Demon.</a><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1Z2HqV5RU5sA152rNE7L5tk-6uxMRb2F7uoV95G1mKxQ/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">And a Daiklave, because I can't not do swords.</a>(And because I make characters suffer.)<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/561-mockery","name":"Mockery","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar561_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"876"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-07T06:32:45-08:00","id":1279184,"title":"","content":"I love it! Easily worth the wait. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24320-taleksi","name":"Taleksi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24320_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"28"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}